{"content": "# 認識\n![float-right](./api/kotoba/met/thumbnails/thumb_architecture.webp?v=9081cba2#full=./projects/archive/02_kotoba/articles/01_met/architecture.webp?v=3f581a0e&w=1638&h=1638)\n\n<div class=\"tab-buttons\">\n<button class=\"tab-btn active\" onclick=\"window.switchTabPanel('p-1', this, 'Group')\">交會</button>\n<button class=\"tab-btn\" onclick=\"window.switchTabPanel('p-2', this, 'Group')\">Met</button>\n<button class=\"tab-btn\" onclick=\"window.switchTabPanel('p-3', this, 'Group')\">逢う時</button>\n</div>\n\n<div id=\"p-1\" class=\"tab-panel\" data-group=\"Group\" style=\"display: block;\">\n\n「我和你的認識，適逢與你的告別。」\n\n</div>\n\n<div id=\"p-2\" class=\"tab-panel\" data-group=\"Group\" style=\"display: none;\">\n<div id=\"lang-en\" class=\"no-format\">\n\n“We met — just in time to say goodbye.”\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div id=\"p-3\" class=\"tab-panel\" data-group=\"Group\" style=\"display: none;\">\n\n:::lang[ja|no-format]\n「最初の言葉は、『さよなら』だった。」\n:::\n\n</div>", "hashes": {"projects/archive/02_kotoba/articles/01_met/architecture.webp": "7c505440", "md_source": "d2299faa", "og_cover": "7c505440", "thumb_cover": "7c505440", "art_detail": "466628a4"}}